{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"dotenv","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Dotenv","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Dotenv (.env .envrc .env.example .env.local).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"dotenv","name":"Dotenv","extensions":[".env",".envrc",".env.example",".env.local",".env.production",".env.development",".env.test"],"grammar":"grammars/dotenv.json","filenames":[".env",".env.example",".env.local",".env.production",".env.development",".env.test",".envrc"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Dotenv","path":"snippets/dotenv.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/dotenv.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*(?:export\\\\s+)?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\}?\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"(?<==)[^#\\\\s\\\"'][^#\\\\s]*\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/dotenv.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Database URL\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"db\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"DATABASE_URL=${1:postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/name}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A database URL\"\n  },\n  \"App settings\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"app\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"APP_ENV=${1:local}\",\n      \"APP_DEBUG=${2:true}\",\n      \"APP_URL=${3:http://localhost}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Common app settings\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Dotenv\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Dotenv.\n\n## Files\n\n`.env`, `.envrc`, `.env.example`, `.env.local`, `.env.production`, `.env.development`, `.env.test`, `.env`, `.env.example`, `.env.local`, `.env.production`, `.env.development`, `.env.test`, `.envrc`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 2 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `db` | A database URL |\n| `app` | Common app settings |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}